# regress/artifacts/fbsdrampair/.gitignore -- written by the fbsdrampair landing.  Part of this folder stays uncommitted (the
# coordinator's rule of 2026-11-05: blobs never leave history; adding a file later is cheap): the per-variant build and probe
# logs, the codex reasoning stream, the stubs and pty transcripts below, and the uncited one-off files present at the landing
# -- 118 files, still on disk.  A file a committed record cites is re-included by a `!` line.  ANY OTHER FILE IS NOT IGNORED --
# an erratum or a new reading shows in `git status`: commit it.  Why each committed file is in: landing_20261105/ARTSET_fbs_why.txt;
# the rule: landing_20261105/ARTSET_RULE.md.

# build logs (per variant, and table 1's base/HEAD/restore builds) and the propagation's make logs
**/build_*.log
**/make_*.log

# probe logs inside the table's runs/ folder (per variant unless re-included below)
**/runs/probe*.out

# codex reasoning streams and launch logs
**/codex_*.err
**/cxlaunch.log

# the 4-byte ARM load stubs the probe and the witness write for themselves
**/*.bin

# pty session transcripts
**/*.pty.txt

# uncited one-off files present at the landing (anchored: the same name elsewhere is not ignored)
/impl_20261105/build1.log
/impl_20261105/build1.run.sh
/impl_20261105/build1.sh
/impl_20261105/build1_make.log
/impl_20261105/fbblock_20261105/block_extracted.sh
/impl_20261105/fbblock_20261105/footbridge_sites.log
/impl_20261105/fbblock_check.run.sh
/impl_20261105/fbblock_check.sh
/impl_20261105/oldprobe_FIX.out
/impl_20261105/oldprobe_HEAD.out
/impl_20261105/oldprobe_check.run.sh
/impl_20261105/oldprobe_check.sh
/impl_20261105/probe_legs.run.sh
/impl_20261105/probe_legs.sh
/impl_20261105/propagate.run.sh
/impl_20261105/propagate.sh
/impl_20261105/restore_clone.run.sh
/impl_20261105/restore_clone.sh
/impl_20261105/witness_fix.run.sh
/impl_20261105/witness_fix.sh

# re-included: files a committed record cites, and each table's records and base/HEAD/null logs (rules 1-3)
!/table1_20261105/runs/probe_HEAD.out
!/table1_20261105/runs/probe_base.out
!/table1_20261105/runs/probe_null_absent.out
!/table1_20261105/runs/probe_null_false.out
!/table1_20261105/runs/probe_null_true.out
